  "description": "Contact Advice4you by WhatsApp, phone or email. Based in Norwich, helping people across Norfolk.",
  "content": "<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605991004802-a3e068de6aa0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=72\",\"dimRatio\":80,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#04070f\",\"minHeight\":420,\"align\":\"full\",\"alt\":\"Elm Hill, a historic cobbled street in Norwich, at night\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:420px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-80 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#04070f\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"Elm Hill, a historic cobbled street in Norwich, at night\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605991004802-a3e068de6aa0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=72\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} -->\n<p class=\"kicker\">Contact</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Send a short message.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell us your name, your language and a few words about the problem. We will reply and agree the next step with you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/447466951175?text=Hello%20Advice4you%2C%20I%20would%20like%20some%20help.\">Message us on WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+447466951175\">Call us</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f6f3ec\",\"text\":\"#0e1424\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f6f3ec;color:#0e1424;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Based in Norwich. Helping people across Norfolk.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href=\"https://wa.me/447466951175?text=Hello%20Advice4you%2C%20I%20would%20like%20some%20help.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">07466 951175</a></li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> [07466 951175](tel:+447466951175)</li><li><strong>Address:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=73A%20Dereham%20Road%2C%20Norwich%2C%20UK\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">73A Dereham Road, Norwich</a> (Open in Maps)</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In your first message</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Your name</li><li>The language you speak</li><li>A few words about the problem</li><li>Any deadline on your letter</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please do not send copies of your passport or ID until we ask for them. We will tell you the safest way to share documents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">In an emergency</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a life is in danger, call 999. For urgent medical help that is not an emergency, call NHS 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
